    {
      "id": "R-I2C-001",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "I2C 主机总线必须用 i2c_new_master_bus() 创建，参数为 i2c_master_bus_config_t 和总线句柄；禁止用旧版 i2c_driver_install()",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_new_master_bus",
        "quote": "esp_err_t i2c_new_master_bus(const i2c_master_bus_config_t *bus_config, i2c_master_bus_handle_t *ret_bus_handle);"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": {
        "type": "api_exists",
        "symbol": "i2c_new_master_bus",
        "header": "driver/i2c_master.h"
      },
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-002",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "总线引脚通过 i2c_master_bus_config_t 的 sda_io_num、scl_io_num 填写；i2c_port 填端口号，-1 表示自动选择",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master_bus_config_t",
        "quote": "gpio_num_t sda_io_num;                /*!< GPIO number of I2C SDA signal, pulled-up internally */"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-003",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "i2c_device_config_t 的 device_address 填 7 位原始地址（不含读写位），地址长度由 dev_addr_length 指定，速率由 scl_speed_hz 指定",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_device_config_t",
        "quote": "uint16_t device_address;                    /*!< I2C device raw address. (The 7/10 bit address without read/write bit)."
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-004",
      "kind": "forbidden",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "禁止使用旧版驱动接口 i2c_driver_install()/i2c_cmd_link_* 命令行接口，v6.1 一律走 i2c_master_* 新接口",
      "cite": {
