      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-005",
      "kind": "pin",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "i2c0 用 SDA=GPIO4、SCL=GPIO5，所有 I2C 器件共用这条总线",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "board-measured",
        "page": 1,
        "section": "板子说明",
        "quote": "I2C0 SDA=GPIO4、SCL=GPIO5"
      },
      "tier": "user",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-006",
      "kind": "timing",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "SCL 用 100 kHz 或 400 kHz 都可正常通信，任选其一即可",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "board-measured",
        "page": 1,
        "section": "M-004 I2C 速率",
        "quote": "100 kHz 和 400 kHz 两种速率下 50 次读取都没有出错"
      },
      "tier": "user",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-001",
      "kind": "device",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "MAX30102 的 7 位从地址固定为 0b1010111（0x57），写地址 0xAE、读地址 0xAF；i2c_device_config_t 里填 7 位地址 0x57",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 29,
        "section": "Table 17. Slave ID Description",
        "quote": "The MAX30102 slave ID consists of seven fixed bits, B7–B1 (set to 0b1010111)."
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-002",
      "kind": "device",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "上电后可读 PART_ID 寄存器 0xFF，值应为 0x15，用于确认器件在线",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 11,
        "section": "PART ID",
        "quote": "Part ID PART_ID[7] 0xFF 0x15 R"
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-003",
      "kind": "sequence",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "开始新的 SpO2 或心率转换前，先把 FIFO_WR_PTR(0x04)、OVF_COUNTER(0x05)、FIFO_RD_PTR(0x06) 全部写 0x00，保证 FIFO 为空且状态已知",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 14,
        "section": "FIFO Data Register",
        "quote": "it is recommended to first clear the FIFO_WR_PTR, OVF_COUNTER, and FIFO_RD_PTR registers to all zeroes (0x00)"
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-004",
      "kind": "register",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "读 FIFO_DATA(0x07) 时寄存器地址不自增，必须在同一 I2C 事务里连续读多字节；一个样本 Red+IR 共 6 字节（每通道 3 字节，左对齐）",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 14,
        "section": "Reading from the FIFO",
        "quote": "Reading the FIFO_DATA register does not automatically increment the register address."
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-005",
      "kind": "forbidden",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "FIFO 相关的 0x04–0x07 虽都可写，但运行中只允许写 FIFO_RD_PTR(0x06)，不要写 FIFO_WR_PTR 与 OVF_COUNTER",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 14,
        "section": "FIFO Data Register",
        "quote": "in practice only the FIFO_RD_PTR register should be written to in operation"
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-006",
      "kind": "register",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "MODE(0x09) 的 MODE[2:0] 只允许用 0b010（仅红光，心率模式）、0b011（红光+IR，SpO2 模式）、0b111（多 LED 模式），其余编码不能使用",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 18,
        "section": "Table 4. Mode Control",
        "quote": "011 SpO2 mode Red and IR"
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-007",
      "kind": "sequence",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "测温流程：先置中断使能 2(0x03) 的 DIE_TEMP_RDY_EN，再置 TEMP_EN(0x21 bit0)，等 DIE_TEMP_RDY 置位后才读 TINT(0x1F)/TFRAC(0x20)；禁止以 TEMP_EN 自动清零作为测完标志",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "board-measured",
        "page": 1,
        "section": "M-003",
        "quote": "测温要等 DIE_TEMP_RDY（需先置 DIE_TEMP_RDY_EN），不能以 TEMP_EN 自动清零作为测完的标志。"
      },
      "tier": "user",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-008",
      "kind": "register",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "DIE_TEMP_RDY 中断通过读中断状态 2(0x01) 或 TFRAC(0x20) 清除；A_FULL/PPG_RDY/ALC_OVF 通过读中断状态 1(0x00) 或读 FIFO_DATA 清除",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 12,
        "section": "DIE_TEMP_RDY",
        "quote": "The interrupt is cleared by reading either the Interrupt Status 2 register (0x01) or the TFRAC register (0x20)."
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MAX30102-009",
      "kind": "register",
      "scope": [
        "max30102"
      ],
      "text": "写 MODE(0x09) 的 RESET 位（bit6）触发上电复位，该位复位完成后自动恢复为 0，不要反复写 1 或轮询等待它保持 1",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "max30102-ds",
        "page": 18,
        "section": "Mode Configuration (0x09)",
        "quote": "The RESET bit is cleared automatically back to zero after the reset sequence is completed."
      },
      "tier": "official_manual",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    }
